.TH "GF-TEAMS-GET-TEAM-PREFERENCES" "1" "May 2026" "" ""

.SH NAME
gf-teams-get-team-preferences - Gets team preferences


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf teams get-team-preferences [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Gets team preferences

.PP
Response schema (GetTeamPreferencesOK.Payload):
  homeDashboardUID      string         UID for the home dashboard
  language              string         Selected language (beta)
  navbar                object
  navbar.bookmarkUrls   array
  queryHistory          object
  queryHistory.homeTab  string         one of: '' | 'query' | 'starred';
  regionalFormat        string         Selected locale (beta)
  theme                 string         light, dark, empty is default
  timezone              string         The timezone selection
                                       TODO: this should use the timezone defined in common
  weekStart             string         day of the week (sunday, monday, etc)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--describe-response-jsonschema\fP[=false]
	Print the JSON Schema of the response payload and exit without calling the API

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for get-team-preferences

.PP
\fB--raw\fP[=false]
	Print the raw HTTP response body instead of the decoded payload

.PP
\fB--team-id\fP=""
	TeamID


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-key\fP=""
	API Key to authenticate to grafana server (env: GF_API_KEY)

